#namecost("TRICKSTER'S SHARD", "10 points")
#para(((emph: "", text: "Charm. One use only. Declare you are using this item at the start of one of your magic phases. For the duration of the phase, when one of the bearer's spells is dispelled by an enemy Wizard, roll a D6. On a 4+, that Wizard suffers a Wound which Ignores Armour Saves."),))
