#items(((runs: ((emph: "bold", text: "Grind Attack:"), (emph: "", text: " In any turn in which the Land Ship does not charge, it inflicts D6 Stomps like a Monster.")), sub: ()), (runs: ((emph: "bold", text: "Stable Platform:"), (emph: "", text: " The crew ignores the rules for Ponderous when moving and shooting.")), sub: ()), (runs: ((emph: "bold", text: "The Wonder of the Age:"), (emph: "", text: " The Land Ship, has two modes of movement: slow and full power. The player must declare which they are using before the Land Ship is moved each turn. Note that the Land Ship cannot pursue.")), sub: (((emph: "bold", text: "Slow:"), (emph: "", text: " The Land Ship may move up to 6\" forward without penalty or risk, but may not charge.")), ((emph: "bold", text: "Full Power:"), (emph: "", text: " The Land Ship follow the rules for Random Movement (3D6) forward. However, if you roll two or more 1's when determining the Land Ships Random Movement, something has gone disastrously wrong. Roll immediately on the Land Ship Calamity Chart and apply the result."))))))
#namecost("THE LAND SHIP CALAMITY CHART", "")
#para(((emph: "bold", text: "D6 Result 1 Abandon Ship!"), (emph: "", text: " The Land Ship is destroyed but left on the table as an area of impassable terrain. Any unit in base contact when this happens suffers D6 Strength 6 hits. "), (emph: "bold", text: "2-3 Arrrrgh!"), (emph: "", text: " The ship moves the rolled distance and an additional D6\", as well as suffering D3 Wounds which Ignores Armour Saves. "), (emph: "bold", text: "4-5 All hands to the Wheel!"), (emph: "", text: " Roll a Scatter dice and move the ship the rolled distance in the direction shown on the dice. If a ‘Hit’ is rolled, the Land Ship remains stationary. "), (emph: "bold", text: "6 Boom!"), (emph: "", text: " All units within D6\" of the Land Ship’s hull suffers D6 Strength 6 Hits and the Land Ship is destroyed and removed from play.")))
#para(((emph: "", text: "When the Land Ship loses its last wound roll a D6. On a roll of a 1, it suffers the effects of the Abandon Ship! result on the Land Ship Calamity table and on a 6 the Boom! result. On any other roll, the Land Ship is removed as normal."),))
#field("NOTES", "")
